@startuml Kafka Broker 请求处理流程

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam participantBorderColor #6C757D
skinparam arrowColor #495057
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3CD
skinparam noteBorderColor #FFEAA7

title Kafka Broker 请求处理完整流程

autonumber

participant "生产者客户端" as Producer
participant "Acceptor线程" as Acceptor
participant "Processor线程" as Processor
participant "RequestChannel" as Channel
participant "RequestHandler线程" as Handler
participant "KafkaApis" as APIs
participant "ReplicaManager" as ReplicaMgr
participant "UnifiedLog" as Log
participant "LogSegment" as Segment

== 1. 连接建立阶段 ==

Producer -> Acceptor: TCP 连接请求
activate Acceptor
note right: 源码位置：SocketServer.scala:604-623\nAcceptor.run() 方法

Acceptor -> Acceptor: serverChannel.accept()
note right: 接受新连接

Acceptor -> Processor: 分发连接到 Processor
activate Processor
note right: 轮询方式分发到不同的 Processor 线程

Processor -> Processor: configureNewConnections()
note right: 配置新连接的 SelectionKey

deactivate Acceptor

== 2. 请求接收阶段 ==

Producer -> Processor: ProduceRequest
note right: 发送生产请求

Processor -> Processor: poll()
note right: 源码位置：SocketServer.scala:919-946\nProcessor.run() 方法

Processor -> Processor: processCompletedReceives()
note right: 处理完成接收的请求

Processor -> Channel: sendRequest(request)
activate Channel
note right: 源码位置：RequestChannel.scala:342-359\n将请求放入队列

Channel -> Channel: requestQueue.offer(request)
note right: 请求入队等待处理

== 3. 请求处理阶段 ==

Handler -> Channel: receiveRequest(timeout)
activate Handler
note right: 源码位置：RequestChannel.scala\nreceiveRequest() 方法

Channel -> Handler: 返回请求对象
deactivate Channel

Handler -> APIs: handle(request)
activate APIs
note right: 源码位置：KafkaApis.scala:89-107\n统一请求处理入口

APIs -> APIs: request.header.apiKey match
note right: 根据 API 类型路由请求

alt 生产请求 (PRODUCE)
    APIs -> APIs: handleProduceRequest(request)
    note right: 处理生产请求

    APIs -> ReplicaMgr: appendRecords(...)
    activate ReplicaMgr
    note right: 源码位置：ReplicaManager.scala:684-706\nappendRecords() 方法

    ReplicaMgr -> ReplicaMgr: appendToLocalLog(...)
    note right: 追加到本地日志

    ReplicaMgr -> Log: appendAsLeader(...)
    activate Log
    note right: 源码位置：UnifiedLog.java\nappendAsLeader() 方法

    Log -> Log: analyzeAndValidateRecords(...)
    note right: 分析和验证记录

    Log -> Segment: append(largestOffset, records)
    activate Segment
    note right: 源码位置：LogSegment.java:238-243\nappend() 方法

    Segment -> Segment: log.append(records)
    note right: 写入文件

    Segment -> Segment: offsetIndex.append(...)
    note right: 更新偏移量索引

    Segment -> Log: 返回追加结果
    deactivate Segment

    Log -> ReplicaMgr: 返回日志追加信息
    deactivate Log

    ReplicaMgr -> ReplicaMgr: addCompletePurgatoryAction(...)
    note right: 添加到延迟操作管理器

    ReplicaMgr -> APIs: 返回追加结果
    deactivate ReplicaMgr

else 消费请求 (FETCH)
    APIs -> APIs: handleFetchRequest(request)
    note right: 处理消费请求

    APIs -> ReplicaMgr: fetchMessages(...)
    activate ReplicaMgr

    ReplicaMgr -> Log: read(...)
    activate Log

    Log -> Segment: read(startOffset, maxSize)
    activate Segment

    Segment -> Segment: translateOffset(startOffset)
    note right: 转换为物理偏移量

    Segment -> Segment: log.slice(position, size)
    note right: 读取数据片段

    Segment -> Log: 返回读取结果
    deactivate Segment

    Log -> ReplicaMgr: 返回消息数据
    deactivate Log

    ReplicaMgr -> APIs: 返回获取结果
    deactivate ReplicaMgr

else 元数据请求 (METADATA)
    APIs -> APIs: handleTopicMetadataRequest(request)
    note right: 处理元数据请求

    APIs -> APIs: metadataCache.getAllTopics()
    note right: 从元数据缓存获取信息

end

== 4. 响应发送阶段 ==

APIs -> APIs: 构建响应对象
note right: 根据处理结果构建响应

APIs -> Channel: sendResponse(request, response)
activate Channel
note right: 发送响应到通道

Channel -> Channel: responseQueue.offer(response)
note right: 响应入队

Channel -> Processor: 通知有响应待发送
deactivate Channel
deactivate APIs
deactivate Handler

Processor -> Processor: processNewResponses()
note right: 处理新响应

Processor -> Processor: selector.send(response)
note right: 通过 NIO Selector 发送

Processor -> Producer: ProduceResponse
deactivate Processor
note right: 响应返回给客户端

== 关键性能优化点 ==

note over Producer, Segment
    <b>性能优化特性：</b>
    
    <b>网络层优化：</b>
    • 单个 Acceptor + 多个 Processor 的线程模型
    • NIO 非阻塞 I/O，提高并发处理能力
    • 请求/响应队列解耦，避免阻塞
    
    <b>存储层优化：</b>
    • 顺序写入日志文件，充分利用磁盘性能
    • 内存映射文件，减少系统调用开销
    • 批量操作，提高吞吐量
    
    <b>索引优化：</b>
    • 稀疏索引设计，平衡内存使用和查找效率
    • 时间索引支持基于时间的快速查找
    • 偏移量索引支持精确定位
    
    <b>并发控制：</b>
    • 分区级别的锁，减少锁竞争
    • 延迟操作管理器，异步处理副本确认
    • 无锁数据结构，提高并发性能
end note

note over APIs, ReplicaMgr
    <b>源码关键路径：</b>
    
    <b>请求路由：</b>
    KafkaApis.handle() → 根据 ApiKeys 分发
    
    <b>生产路径：</b>
    handleProduceRequest() → ReplicaManager.appendRecords()
    → UnifiedLog.appendAsLeader() → LogSegment.append()
    
    <b>消费路径：</b>
    handleFetchRequest() → ReplicaManager.fetchMessages()
    → UnifiedLog.read() → LogSegment.read()
    
    <b>元数据路径：</b>
    handleTopicMetadataRequest() → MetadataCache.getAllTopics()
end note

@enduml
